<p dir="auto"><a href="https://github.com/kujolang/packwrite/releases/tag/v1.1.1"><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/03438ac5d105d8c0163024798193b72e542e9635a1ec8d268fcaac5c601b61c8/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f76657273696f6e2d312e312e312d626c61636b" alt="Version" data-canonical-src="https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.1.1-black" style="max-width: 100%;"></a>
<a href="/kujolang/packwrite/blob/b8467535c74263abc59fd3f48028b67d42cd7e68/LICENSE"><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/be07a68b57a673af622198c336264f89d82bf4cd5d87bc0cb3f7b6ae47cc43ea/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f6c6963656e73652d4d49542d6c6967687467726579" alt="License" data-canonical-src="https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-lightgrey" style="max-width: 100%;"></a>
<a href="https://github.com/kujolang/kujo"><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/6b3480f7d340221eb016f867281fb8ec9c90042bc68ea9e663eb4651d2bb75f1/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f6275696c74253230776974682d4b756a6f2d77686974652e737667" alt="built with Kujo" data-canonical-src="https://img.shields.io/badge/built%20with-Kujo-white.svg" style="max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>PackWrite turns a project brief into a validated execution pack for coding agents.</strong></p>
<p dir="auto">Save your brief as <code>MEGA_PROMPT.md</code> and run PackWrite in your repository. It sends
the brief and a small repository summary to a model, then writes an <code>agent/</code> directory
with phase plans, acceptance criteria, handoff notes, and review prompts. PackWrite
checks the pack's structure and paths; you review its content before using it.</p>
<div class="snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="strategy AI → MEGA_PROMPT.md → packwrite → /agent pack → implementation agent → reviewer"><pre lang="text" class="notranslate"><code>strategy AI → MEGA_PROMPT.md → packwrite → /agent pack → implementation agent → reviewer
</code></pre></div>
